      "questionText": "<p><strong>Read the conversation and then choose the correct answer to fill in each blank.</strong></p>\n<p>Tom: Hey, Linda! Have you decided what you want to do after graduation?</p>\n<p>Linda: I&#8217;m still thinking about it. I&#8217;m curious about teaching, but I also like business. What about you?</p>\n<p>Tom: I&#8217;ve already made a decision. I want to be a graphic designer. I think it&#8217;s the best choice for me. I&#8217;ve always been interested in art and technology.</p>\n<p>Linda: That sounds great! I admire your <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-913655-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-913655-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-913655-0'></option><option value=\"hesitant\" data-testid='fillblank-option-913655-0-hesitant'>hesitant</option><option value=\"decisive\" data-testid='fillblank-option-913655-0-decisive'>decisive</option></select></span> </strong>attitude. I&#8217;m still unsure about which path is <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-913655-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-913655-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-913655-1'></option><option value=\"suitable\" data-testid='fillblank-option-913655-1-suitable'>suitable</option><option value=\"famous\" data-testid='fillblank-option-913655-1-famous'>famous</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;for me.</p>\n<p>Tom: Don&#8217;t worry, Linda. Just being <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-913655-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-913655-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-913655-2'></option><option value=\"challenging\" data-testid='fillblank-option-913655-2-challenging'>challenging</option><option value=\"inquiring\" data-testid='fillblank-option-913655-2-inquiring'>inquiring<