      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Complete the text, using the words given. You may make any changes to the words if necessary.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.03%;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"10\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>prepare</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>passion</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>insist</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7144%; text-align: center;\"><strong>income</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>Sarah has always had a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-913660-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-913660-0' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-913660-0' /></span></strong> for cooking. She dreams of becoming a chef and opening her own restaurant. However, she also knows that a career in cooking can be challenging. It may not always provide a high <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-913660-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-913660-1' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-913660-1' /></span></strong> at first.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Before making her decision, Sarah plans to<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-913660-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-913660-2' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-913660-2' /></span></strong> for this job by working as a kitchen assistant in a few restaurants. This way, she can learn more about the industry and improve her skills. Her parents, however, <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-913660-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-913660-3' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-913660-3' /></span></strong> that she should consider other careers that may offer more financial security. Despite this, Sarah feels that following her interests is the right choice for her future. She is determined to pursue her dream and work hard to make it a reality, even if it means facing some challenges along the way.</p>",
